Siemens NX

  Not included, and not includable. The pipeline drives a local NX installation
  through its own executables (NXBIN/step242.exe, NXBIN/run_journal.exe) and
  reads its feature schema (UGII/customization_base.xml). NX is commercial
  software under Siemens' licence; nothing from it is redistributed here.

  The ontology quotes NX's declared class and attribute names and pins the
  sha256 of the two installed XML files it was transcribed from, so that what
  was read can be checked against a given install.
